 "claim_caveats": [
  "Shared instrument: the holdout ball truth is a purple/dark HSV blob fit confirmed by eye, and the lane-gated-ball far refine is a purple disc filter; the truth boards come from same-frame wood->gutter edge lines, and the composition lane is per-frame wood-mask gutter edges. The px and board agreement measures agreement with that shared instrument, and v1 (SAM masks) is scored on the instrument v2 copies. Absolute board accuracy below ~1.5 boards is not established: the truth pin ruler and the edge profile disagree by 1-2 boards (px/in 1.67 vs 2.1).",
  "Post-selection: the ball and lane stages were picked from the judges' holdout rows (judge_*.json), hence the leave-one-out flips in sensitivity, so the holdout means are not a fresh test. before_after (n=10) also mixes in the 5 dev stems on which the refine thresholds and the smoothing were tuned; before_after_holdout is the n=5 view.",
  "Entry convention: every tracker evaluates at the cuts.json pin_hit; 192142 and 192636 truth entry is at the observed contact 10 and 4 frames later, so most of their entry_err is that convention.",
  "Fix-pass series rule (clean_series) was written after the skeptics read the 191820 holdout row; its threshold sits between the largest kept tail deviation (4.51 boards) and the smallest rejected one (20.12) on these 10 stems."
 ],
